WEBVTT

00:04.660 --> 00:07.800
It hurts, it hurts! My stomach hurts!

00:08.070 --> 00:08.790
Liar!

00:09.100 --> 00:11.910
The Son of God wouldn't get something like a stomachache.

00:12.380 --> 00:15.170
It's Sunday, so you'd better get up!

00:15.230 --> 00:17.650
But it really does hurt!

00:19.630 --> 00:21.840
Was yesterday really that awkward for you?

00:28.260 --> 00:31.580
I totally went out of my way to get things going with Kumiko.

00:32.260 --> 00:33.730
But that Misa had to go and screw things up.

00:39.510 --> 00:40.960
You okay, Komori?

00:41.270 --> 00:41.840
Yeah.

00:44.980 --> 00:47.500
Kamiyama, you pervert!

00:52.230 --> 00:52.720
But...

00:54.750 --> 00:57.250
If this keeps up, she'll end up hating him.

00:57.990 --> 00:58.750
T-T-Tenko!

00:58.920 --> 01:00.050
That hurts!

01:02.660 --> 01:03.320
What the hell is this?

01:05.150 --> 01:06.520
You can do the rest yourself, okay?

01:06.520 --> 01:07.070
What?

01:07.340 --> 01:08.080
Hey!

01:08.350 --> 01:09.100
Tenko!

01:11.550 --> 01:12.480
Sorry, Meme!

01:16.800 --> 01:17.890
Hey, Tenko!

01:19.030 --> 01:20.780
Help me out here, Meme.

01:22.740 --> 01:23.840
Hey, wait a sec!

01:23.840 --> 01:24.750
Meme?

01:25.490 --> 01:26.170
Me-

01:28.150 --> 01:29.060
san?

01:49.680 --> 01:55.000
dare mo shiranai basho de

01:49.680 --> 01:55.000
In a place unknown to everyone

01:55.820 --> 02:00.680
asa ga umare hajimeru

01:55.820 --> 02:00.680
The dawn is being born

02:01.040 --> 02:07.120
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

02:01.040 --> 02:07.120
The wishes you made upon a star

02:07.120 --> 02:13.020
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

02:07.120 --> 02:13.020
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

02:13.320 --> 02:21.930
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

02:13.320 --> 02:21.930
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

02:25.120 --> 02:28.250
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

02:25.120 --> 02:28.250
And my voice envelops the entire world

02:28.270 --> 02:31.340
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

02:28.270 --> 02:31.340
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

02:31.360 --> 02:34.270
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

02:31.360 --> 02:34.270
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

02:34.520 --> 02:37.410
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

02:34.520 --> 02:37.410
And you'll never really lose them

02:37.410 --> 02:40.490
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

02:37.410 --> 02:40.490
My fingers touch all of creation

02:40.490 --> 02:45.880
tobira akete haruka kanata e

02:40.490 --> 02:45.880
Open the door and escape to a distant place

03:04.440 --> 03:06.060
Trembling Heart Roulette

03:04.440 --> 03:06.060
Timing, Editing, Encoding, "Translation", Muxing: Chikushou

03:10.540 --> 03:12.410
C'mon, Mama, let's play!

03:12.410 --> 03:14.620
Aww, Papa's such a joker!

03:14.770 --> 03:17.310
--Looks like we gotta head over that way!

03:16.460 --> 03:19.600
No~ if we keep this up I'm gonna be totally wet!

03:19.620 --> 03:21.330
See? Feels good, huh?

03:21.580 --> 03:24.310
--Round and round, round and round we go!

03:21.680 --> 03:26.140
Spin me, spin me! Right round!

03:27.590 --> 03:29.670
Papa, let's go over there next!

03:29.780 --> 03:33.200
--Take that! Down we go!

03:30.030 --> 03:31.430
Mama, that's a little bit...

03:32.130 --> 03:33.490
Slide!

03:33.430 --> 03:34.400
JEEZ!

03:34.590 --> 03:38.020
You're not kids, so STOP IT!

03:38.490 --> 03:41.590
Sheesh, you two are always screwing around like this!

03:40.990 --> 03:43.180
Uh, where'd Sis go?

03:43.780 --> 03:46.910
She said it sucks when you're all pissed off.

03:47.040 --> 03:49.890
So she went out, and hasn't come back yet.

03:51.130 --> 03:53.400
Meh, Sish cam be shush a bish shometimes.

03:53.400 --> 03:56.040
Anyway, are things going well with Kumiko?

03:57.710 --> 03:58.890
No way!

03:58.890 --> 04:00.210
There's no way they could be!

04:00.440 --> 04:01.980
Man, you're such a little kid.

04:02.250 --> 04:04.440
Aren't roses and wine the way to go?

04:04.440 --> 04:04.900
Huh?

04:05.270 --> 04:07.460
If you're talking about girls, you've got to have roses and wine.

04:07.850 --> 04:08.200
See?

04:08.550 --> 04:10.310
It's written in this manga, too.

04:15.300 --> 04:16.580
--<i>S'il vous plaît?</i>

04:15.710 --> 04:17.700
Me-me-me... Is this a...

04:21.120 --> 04:21.740
This!

04:22.010 --> 04:23.850
It's one of those explicit comics!

04:24.080 --> 04:24.940
And?

04:25.290 --> 04:28.080
Kids shouldn't be reading stuff like this!

04:28.800 --> 04:29.320
Why not?

04:29.690 --> 04:30.370
Well...

04:32.520 --> 04:34.340
Uh... umm...

04:36.590 --> 04:38.530
Umm, well, you know...

04:41.250 --> 04:44.020
Jeez, who's is this anyway?!

04:44.020 --> 04:45.710
Ah! Here it is!

04:45.710 --> 04:49.800
Mama's favorite, "Real Stories of a Bad Girl's Three Forbidden Pleasures"!

04:49.840 --> 04:53.150
Ah~ Where was this thing? I've been looking for it!

04:53.330 --> 04:55.930
Forbidden pleasure! Forbidden pleasure! Dirty, dirty pleasure!

04:55.990 --> 04:57.480
Papa! Mama!

05:05.820 --> 05:08.530
If Samatarou is really in love with Kumiko, then...

05:09.210 --> 05:12.570
I've got to do something as his guardian angel.

05:13.980 --> 05:15.610
No way! C'mon...

05:16.640 --> 05:18.480
I'm not getting stupid crap like roses and wine.

05:18.660 --> 05:20.670
That's why I told you we could get other things!

05:20.890 --> 05:23.560
'Cause girls love getting presents, you know!

05:23.950 --> 05:27.110
Something like buying her a present isn't gonna solve anything.

05:27.870 --> 05:30.660
It's obvious she already hates me.

05:30.990 --> 05:32.000
You sure about that?

05:32.540 --> 05:33.360
What if you're wrong?

05:33.670 --> 05:35.280
I'm totally sure about it!

05:36.670 --> 05:39.950
So, are you just gonna give up now and do nothing?

05:40.470 --> 05:41.890
Eh, well... That's a little bit...

05:44.370 --> 05:46.990
If you're not gonna give up, you've got to do this!

05:47.530 --> 05:48.850
Yeah, I guess you're right.

05:49.200 --> 05:50.500
Of course I am!

05:51.040 --> 05:51.610
C'mon, let's go!

05:52.830 --> 05:53.120
Huh?

05:53.760 --> 05:54.590
What is it now?

05:54.690 --> 05:55.310
Look at that!

06:01.610 --> 06:02.680
So cute!

06:03.260 --> 06:04.740
Those are cool earrings!

06:06.440 --> 06:08.170
They've got teacups and all sorts of other stuff!

06:10.200 --> 06:13.230
"Angel Shop: Mirac", huh?

06:13.620 --> 06:15.710
Just how long has this place been here?

06:18.390 --> 06:19.510
It's an orgel!

06:18.390 --> 06:19.510
Note: Orgel is Dutch for "music box".

06:41.950 --> 06:43.290
Hey, it's closed.

06:44.140 --> 06:45.090
I want this!

06:45.250 --> 06:46.450
I really want it!

06:46.820 --> 06:48.580
Even if you want it, they're closed.

06:48.950 --> 06:49.750
Let's get going.

06:49.840 --> 06:50.910
E-eh?

06:51.220 --> 06:53.160
Aww, wait up!

06:59.250 --> 06:59.950
This is cute!

07:00.300 --> 07:01.150
Let's get this!

07:01.560 --> 07:04.020
Why a stuffed animal? She's not a kid, you know.

07:04.390 --> 07:06.430
I don't want Kumiko to think I'm a little brat or something.

07:06.660 --> 07:07.570
Huh?

07:07.710 --> 07:09.260
But I like it...

07:09.630 --> 07:11.140
That's 'cause you're a little brat!

07:11.290 --> 07:12.480
What'd you say?!

07:12.880 --> 07:14.180
How about this?

07:49.610 --> 07:51.090
Are you alright, Samatarou?

07:51.570 --> 07:53.920
I'm not alright! Watch where you drop those!

08:02.590 --> 08:03.460
Aww...

08:03.830 --> 08:06.180
I think the other store would've been much better.

08:06.780 --> 08:08.620
"Angel Shop: Mirac"!

08:09.090 --> 08:09.880
Tenko!

08:09.900 --> 08:13.310
The present isn't for you. It's for Kumiko. Got it?

08:13.930 --> 08:16.030
Yeah, yeah. I got it.

08:17.150 --> 08:19.670
I wonder what would make Kumiko happy?

08:20.450 --> 08:25.300
If it was me, I wouldn't care whether what I got was boring, as long as it was something from the person I love.

08:27.140 --> 08:28.540
Something like this, for example.

08:29.760 --> 08:30.220
"Love".

08:32.610 --> 08:33.790
What a load!

08:33.790 --> 08:35.130
This thing's totally embarrassing!

08:35.210 --> 08:36.370
What's that?

08:36.510 --> 08:37.540
Look seriously.

08:38.210 --> 08:39.200
But Tenko....

08:39.940 --> 08:41.100
thinks this suits her!

08:41.340 --> 08:43.260
Please allow me to take indulgence in you buying this for me, Master.

08:43.760 --> 08:44.320
Huh?

08:44.420 --> 08:45.780
Why should I get this for you?

08:46.090 --> 08:48.940
For the guardian angel who is always by your side...

08:49.020 --> 08:54.720
It it certainly within reason to purchase a gift on occasion, Master.

08:55.260 --> 08:57.920
Quit talking like you're in some sort of maid cafe.

08:58.190 --> 08:59.310
Then, buy it.

08:59.860 --> 09:00.670
No way.

09:00.940 --> 09:02.530
Fine, then I'll just have to...

09:08.740 --> 09:10.520
It's already been written on, see?

09:13.430 --> 09:13.980
Eh?

09:14.170 --> 09:15.570
1600 yen?

09:14.170 --> 09:15.570
Note: About $15.

09:15.930 --> 09:18.400
Why do I have to get something so expensive for Tenko?

09:24.330 --> 09:26.430
Why's it gotta turn out like this?

09:29.410 --> 09:32.770
We ended up not getting a present for Kumiko.

09:33.040 --> 09:35.770
It's not that I didn't buy anything. I couldn't buy anything!

09:36.060 --> 09:38.430
You made me buy that stupid thing.

09:40.080 --> 09:43.820
I already blew the allowance I got from Ma, and now I don't have any spending money.

09:43.920 --> 09:44.480
Huh?

09:45.820 --> 09:46.420
Meme?

09:46.670 --> 09:47.930
Where's the roses and wine?

09:48.010 --> 09:50.260
Why the hell would I buy crap like that?

09:50.380 --> 09:52.670
Samatarou, you don't have to be so mean.

09:52.800 --> 09:53.170
Shut it!

10:08.180 --> 10:09.290
Kumiko...

10:11.150 --> 10:18.230
"My first memento present from Samatarou was a key holder".

10:37.830 --> 10:39.660
I'm not going in there!

10:39.910 --> 10:42.430
Jeez, how long are you going to keep this tantrum up?

10:42.490 --> 10:45.260
But... I don't know how I'm supposed to face Kumiko...

10:45.630 --> 10:47.280
I don't wanna go! Don't wanna go!

10:47.490 --> 10:48.910
--C'mon, I wanna go home!

10:48.890 --> 10:51.680
Quit acting like a little boy on his first day of school.

10:51.850 --> 10:55.070
I'm fine with being a kid. Stop it! I don't wanna!

10:55.070 --> 10:57.540
--Let me go! C'mon!

10:56.620 --> 10:57.540
Kamiyama...

11:08.920 --> 11:09.870
Kumiko?

11:09.870 --> 11:10.860
What's wrong?

11:11.010 --> 11:11.480
Well...

11:11.980 --> 11:14.120
I'm sorry about what happened at the pool.

11:14.660 --> 11:16.520
I think I might have said too much.

11:17.050 --> 11:18.540
Eh? That's not true.

11:19.430 --> 11:20.690
We should apologize as well!

11:21.060 --> 11:22.570
I'm sure you were surprised by a lot of things.

11:23.210 --> 11:25.290
Were you waiting here to apologize?

11:25.440 --> 11:25.950
Yes.

11:26.180 --> 11:27.090
And...

11:28.820 --> 11:29.900
If it's okay...

11:30.270 --> 11:32.500
Would you become friends with me?

12:00.840 --> 12:02.480
Stay level-headed, Samatarou.

12:03.050 --> 12:05.920
These are just some omlettes I made, but...

12:06.420 --> 12:07.000
Please have some.

12:11.130 --> 12:12.030
Th-thank you.

12:13.310 --> 12:15.940
Woah, Kumiko's own omelets!

12:16.740 --> 12:19.050
I just transferred here, so...

12:19.470 --> 12:21.470
I haven't been able to make any friends yet.

12:21.960 --> 12:26.090
But I'm glad to have made a friend in the short time I've been here.

12:27.040 --> 12:28.920
I'm happy too!

12:31.010 --> 12:32.910
Don't be happy with just being friends!

12:33.090 --> 12:34.480
You're supposed to be making her your girlfriend.

12:34.600 --> 12:36.230
Oh yeah, this is terrible!

12:37.990 --> 12:39.820
The omelets aren't good?

12:40.240 --> 12:42.780
Uhh.. No no no no!

12:42.780 --> 12:44.510
They're totally delicious!

12:44.740 --> 12:47.980
They're the best I've ever had! No, probably the best in the universe!

12:49.070 --> 12:49.820
Thank God.

12:50.790 --> 12:54.590
He's never said anything like that about my omelets...

13:01.050 --> 13:04.250
Note: The teacher is writing the beginning of one of the poems from the <i>Konjaku Monogatari</i> on the board. They all start as "ima wa mukashi/konjaku."  "Once upon a time" is pushing it, but you get the idea.

13:04.320 --> 13:04.960
Something's not right...

13:05.160 --> 13:11.020
It's a collection of more than 1,000 poetic stories written between 794 -1192, of various origins and written in Classical Japanese.

13:11.020 --> 13:14.520
It feels like my heart is full of pins and needles or something.

13:20.570 --> 13:23.040
I don't know which one this is, exactly. Some are required reading in high school, like Shakespeare is in the English-speaking world.

13:20.570 --> 13:23.040
I can't take this heat! Let's just quit!

13:23.220 --> 13:24.030
Huh?

13:24.030 --> 13:25.890
The teacher seems kinda messed up.

13:25.890 --> 13:27.500
This couldn't be about bloomers again, could it?

13:27.620 --> 13:29.910
Heey! He's gonna blow again!

13:31.710 --> 13:34.610
On an afternoon like this, we should go outside and exercise our bodies!

13:34.760 --> 13:38.280
Do your stretches and gather up outside!

13:43.220 --> 13:44.180
Don't tell me...

13:44.640 --> 13:45.660
Who was it this time?

13:47.320 --> 13:48.370
Pops?

13:50.420 --> 13:51.660
Sis?

13:54.100 --> 13:55.510
Or was it Ma?

13:56.660 --> 13:57.590
Cleaning cleaning~

13:57.530 --> 13:58.580
<i>This might be fun!</i>

14:00.360 --> 14:02.380
Ye-yeah. You're right.

14:02.980 --> 14:06.840
I guess PE is better than sitting through a lecture.

14:11.210 --> 14:12.770
My body feels all heavy...

14:13.860 --> 14:15.480
What's wrong, Tenko?

14:16.300 --> 14:18.050
Ah, I'm just a little sleepy...

14:18.650 --> 14:19.790
Are you sick?

14:20.090 --> 14:22.530
Should I go to the Nurse's office with you?

14:22.780 --> 14:24.880
Nah, I'm okay.

14:24.880 --> 14:26.360
--If I stay like this for awhile, I...

14:25.850 --> 14:27.260
If you're tired, just sleep.

14:27.410 --> 14:29.790
That gay teacher wouldn't care if you did.

14:27.410 --> 14:29.790
Note: I'm pretty sure this is what he's saying, in reference to the bloomers-wearing incident in episode 1.

14:30.850 --> 14:32.170
Kumiko, let's go!

14:32.450 --> 14:33.470
O-okay.

14:38.830 --> 14:39.830
He left...

14:41.540 --> 14:42.750
Just like he always does...

14:42.990 --> 14:43.860
"Dumbass."

14:43.980 --> 14:46.720
"If you go outside, you'll stop feeling so tired!"

14:47.000 --> 14:48.080
"C'mon, c'mon!"

14:48.080 --> 14:49.860
I wish he'd say something like that.

15:00.940 --> 15:04.860
Okay, now we're going to have the guys and girls pair up and then have a three-legged race.

15:05.040 --> 15:06.160
Kamiyama and...

15:06.520 --> 15:07.390
Komori.

15:08.050 --> 15:08.960
Yes.

15:08.960 --> 15:10.520
The rest... Uh, just do whatever.

15:10.700 --> 15:12.330
Okay~

15:12.960 --> 15:14.590
What's up with this pairing?

15:19.740 --> 15:21.310
Will you tie this on for me?

15:21.310 --> 15:22.540
Ah, sure.

15:28.600 --> 15:30.320
That tickles~

15:37.000 --> 15:38.180
S-sorry!

15:38.450 --> 15:40.180
Are you laughing at me?

15:40.180 --> 15:42.180
Am I that worthless as a woman?

15:42.270 --> 15:43.900
Kamiyama, you jerk!

15:45.410 --> 15:48.300
Kumiko, why are you crying all of the sudden?

15:48.300 --> 15:50.170
Oh, Kamiyama...

15:50.170 --> 15:51.610
I'm not crying!

15:51.610 --> 15:55.290
I've got a better place for you to bind us together!

15:58.330 --> 15:59.750
This really is weird.

16:00.020 --> 16:02.460
Who the hell is doing it this time?

16:05.920 --> 16:07.040
That'd be Meme.

16:07.040 --> 16:07.700
Look forward to working with me.

16:08.480 --> 16:10.770
Meme! Why are you doing something like this?

16:10.980 --> 16:13.300
My school got out earlier this morning

16:13.570 --> 16:14.510
Or something.

16:14.720 --> 16:15.770
Ta-da.

16:16.010 --> 16:22.070
To help you out, I've made a roulette wheel that can control the whims of a woman's heart.

16:16.010 --> 16:22.070
Note: The four main sections of the roulette wheel are, from 12 o'clock and clockwise: Delighted, Angry, Coldhearted, and Comfortable

16:22.370 --> 16:25.720
Behold! Meme's Emotional Roulette!

16:22.370 --> 16:25.720
Smaller sections, like a clock: pleasant feeling, love, hot, turned on | offended, really pissed off, impatient, afraid | sad, cold, pitiful, embarrassed | ticklish, itchy, (romantic) love, cheerful

16:25.960 --> 16:27.970
So, because of that, Kumiko is...

16:27.970 --> 16:30.080
Yeah. I wanted to test it out a little.

16:30.080 --> 16:31.140
Lookin' good.

16:31.140 --> 16:33.280
So, the teacher and everyone else in the class, too?

16:33.460 --> 16:35.810
As a goddess, I must try to be impartial.

16:37.040 --> 16:39.420
I've made it for practice as a goddess.

16:39.810 --> 16:40.840
You...

16:40.840 --> 16:46.110
If I control Kumiko's emotions with this, you'll get a girlfriend.

16:46.620 --> 16:47.220
Okay?

16:47.280 --> 16:49.820
Du-dumbass! This is none of your business!

16:50.180 --> 16:53.730
I'm trying to win her heart with my own power!

16:55.840 --> 16:57.440
So you don't want this?

16:57.440 --> 16:59.060
I don't!

17:00.450 --> 17:03.460
Then, enjoy the three-legged race.

17:03.640 --> 17:04.490
Bye bye.

17:06.590 --> 17:08.100
He didn't go for it after all.

17:13.730 --> 17:15.510
Meme... Tenko...

17:15.660 --> 17:17.230
I wish they could leave me alone for just one second!

17:21.930 --> 17:26.390
I wonder if it was okay to leave her behind like that?

17:30.420 --> 17:31.450
S-sorry!

17:31.750 --> 17:32.740
You okay?

17:32.830 --> 17:33.620
Yeah.

17:34.460 --> 17:35.480
Then, let's try again.

17:35.820 --> 17:36.270
Okay!

17:36.930 --> 17:38.050
Ready. Set.

17:48.410 --> 17:51.270
Man, what the heck was Meme thinking?

17:51.840 --> 17:55.560
Well, I'd be lying if I said I wasn't enjoying this.

17:57.390 --> 17:59.640
Just what are you ogling at?

17:59.640 --> 18:01.300
Eh? N-nothing.

18:01.300 --> 18:03.320
Yeah right. Don't lie.

18:03.380 --> 18:05.400
You were ogling me.

18:05.400 --> 18:08.080
You were thinking about dirty stuff, weren't you!

18:14.980 --> 18:18.620
Dirty stuff? I wasn't thinking about anything like that at all.

18:18.770 --> 18:23.560
Oh you! It's completely okay for you to think dirty thoughts!

18:23.560 --> 18:26.490
It's natural for a boy, isn't it?

18:26.550 --> 18:29.680
Kumiko, you don't have to rub against me like that!

18:30.880 --> 18:33.930
K-K-K-Kumiko, how far are you going to take us?

18:35.100 --> 18:36.670
You're so insensitive!

18:36.670 --> 18:38.960
Am I that unappealing to you?

18:39.110 --> 18:41.220
No... You're plenty appealing!

18:41.610 --> 18:45.860
Anyway, why are you worrying about that now, when we're running off like this?

18:46.280 --> 18:48.540
I thought that little devil said she'd stop!

18:50.290 --> 18:51.640
What could this be?

18:54.980 --> 18:55.650
No~

19:08.690 --> 19:09.470
I'm all hot.

19:09.660 --> 19:10.560
It's so hot!

19:10.560 --> 19:11.070
Eh?

19:11.220 --> 19:12.010
It's hot!

19:12.910 --> 19:15.710
This is getting pretty bad! Stop it already!

19:16.010 --> 19:16.640
This sucks.

19:30.980 --> 19:31.800
Oh shit!

19:35.680 --> 19:36.710
Kamiyama!

19:40.900 --> 19:42.640
You protected me, didn't you?

19:43.490 --> 19:44.480
Are you okay?

19:44.600 --> 19:46.020
Yeah... somehow.

19:46.020 --> 19:48.280
More importantly, are you hurt?

19:48.520 --> 19:49.330
No.

19:49.360 --> 19:50.660
Oh, that's good.

20:01.590 --> 20:02.400
Samatarou...

20:04.930 --> 20:05.630
What's up with this?

20:06.650 --> 20:08.610
It's always stopping in the same spot.

20:09.940 --> 20:11.380
Is it broken?

20:09.940 --> 20:11.380
Note: It's landing on romantic love.

20:13.670 --> 20:14.390
Hey!

20:14.390 --> 20:15.690
Wait up, Samatarou!

20:15.960 --> 20:17.530
Samatarou, jeez!

20:17.530 --> 20:19.210
I'm gonna get her a present after all!

20:19.210 --> 20:21.900
And then I'll tell her my feelings!

20:22.140 --> 20:24.400
Why's he in such a good moon all of the sudden?

20:26.870 --> 20:29.280
Umm, let's see..

20:29.280 --> 20:31.540
Hm, how about this?

20:32.590 --> 20:33.280
This is it!

20:33.640 --> 20:34.160
That?

20:34.610 --> 20:35.990
It says "love"!

20:36.750 --> 20:37.860
Is this no good?

20:38.220 --> 20:39.130
But that's...

20:39.340 --> 20:42.410
This kinda thing might be mad expensive, but..

20:42.560 --> 20:47.770
Well, as a present for Kumiko, even 1,600 yen is too cheap.

20:48.470 --> 20:49.940
I'll get this!

20:56.270 --> 20:57.590
He doesn't remember...

20:59.280 --> 21:00.730
Okay, just this, correct?

21:00.670 --> 21:01.600
You jerk!

21:01.720 --> 21:02.870
You asshole!

21:02.870 --> 21:03.770
I hate you!

21:03.920 --> 21:06.060
What's going on with you, Tenko? What's wrong?

21:06.060 --> 21:08.200
Shut up! Just shut up!

21:08.590 --> 21:09.880
You're bothering the other customers.

21:10.220 --> 21:13.620
Who cares! You don't get it! You don't get anything about me!

21:15.160 --> 21:16.150
Tenko?

21:17.020 --> 21:17.960
Why?

21:18.560 --> 21:19.190
Why's he have to...

21:20.310 --> 21:22.420
That key holder was supposed to just be for me.

21:28.170 --> 21:29.470
Would you guys please gather up?

21:29.710 --> 21:30.340
Huh?

21:32.540 --> 21:35.640
If I stop doing that, how am I supposed to have any fun?!

21:35.850 --> 21:39.860
If he's saying something like that, the love of his mother must not be enough for him!

21:39.860 --> 21:41.300
I've said it a thousand times!

21:41.550 --> 21:45.070
I want to win Kumiko's heart with my own power!

21:45.130 --> 21:47.990
But, as long as I'm the Son of God...

21:48.440 --> 21:50.250
Nobody's ever going to leave me alone.

22:00.130 --> 22:01.370
Then, Samatarou...

22:01.520 --> 22:03.120
Are you serious about this?

22:03.240 --> 22:03.840
Yeah.

22:04.320 --> 22:05.920
I want to become human!

22:08.870 --> 22:10.710
I've had enough of being the Son of God!

22:11.250 --> 22:15.320
I'll become human, and do this all by myself!

22:17.390 --> 22:19.470
Samatarou's going to become human?

22:19.800 --> 22:20.950
That can't be...

22:21.610 --> 22:23.270
If that happens, an angel like me...

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
Oh, please, God, allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
kotaenasai

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:03.740 --> 24:05.840
If he becomes human, I won't be needed anymore.

24:05.960 --> 24:08.310
I can definitely confess to Kumiko like this!

24:08.560 --> 24:10.300
Samatarou's true feelings...

24:10.660 --> 24:11.270
Sis?

24:11.630 --> 24:12.650
Ma? Meme?

24:13.190 --> 24:14.520
What's up? Something's weird.

24:14.520 --> 24:16.180
Everything has been put into action.

24:16.180 --> 24:16.780
That's right..

24:16.780 --> 24:17.380
What about Tenko?

24:17.380 --> 24:18.230
She's been erased.

24:18.650 --> 24:20.240
Next time on Kamisama Kazoku:

24:20.820 --> 24:23.440
Tenko's Tears Upon Her Glittering Wings

24:24.470 --> 24:27.150
Please don't forget about me, Samatarou!
